      "type": "\u2200 {P B : Finset \u2115},\n  (\u2200 p \u2208 P, Nat.Prime p) \u2192\n    (\u2200 p \u2208 B, Nat.Prime p) \u2192\n      Disjoint P B \u2192 \u2200 {u : \u211d}, (\u2200 p \u2208 B, u \u2264 Real.log \u2191p) \u2192 primeNoteCascade (P \u222a B) u = primeNoteCascade P u"
