      "type": "\u2200 {P B : Finset \u2115},\n  (\u2200 p \u2208 P, Nat.Prime p) \u2192\n    (\u2200 p \u2208 B, Nat.Prime p) \u2192\n      Disjoint P B \u2192\n        \u2200 {T : \u211d},\n          0 \u2264 T \u2192\n            (\u2200 p \u2208 B, \u2200 q \u2208 B, p \u2260 q \u2192 T \u2264 Real.log \u2191p + Real.log \u2191q) \u2192\n              noteEnergy (primeNoteCascade (P \u222a B)) T =\n                noteEnergy (primeNoteCascade P) T + noteEnergy (primeBlockEcho P B) T -\n                  2 * \u222b (u : \u211d) in 0..T, primeNoteCascade P u * primeBlockEcho P B u"
